{
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "image_search",
      "description": "Get Image Search By Pic\n\n图搜商品: 根据图片搜索商品\n\n### Responses:\n\n**200**: Successful Response (Success Response)\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n**Example Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"error_code\": 1,\n  \"error_msg\": \"Error Msg\"\n}\n```",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "img_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "img_url",
            "description": "图片url"
          },
          "is_auto_first_cate_name": {
            "type": "integer",
            "title": "is_auto_first_cate_name",
            "description": "是否开启识别分类,0-不开启，1-开启"
          }
        },
        "title": "image_searchArguments",
        "required": [
          "img_url",
          "is_auto_first_cate_name"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "universal_content_search",
      "description": "Get Universal Content Search\n\n内容搜索Pro：执行互联网内容搜索，获取最新内容、网页、图片、新闻等信息\n\n### Responses:\n\n**200**: Successful Response (Success Response)\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n**Example Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"error_code\": 1,\n  \"error_msg\": \"Error Msg\"\n}\n```",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "query": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 100,
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "query",
            "description": "用户的搜索问题，支持长度范围1~100个字符"
          },
          "time_range": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "OneDay",
                  "OneWeek",
                  "OneMonth",
                  "OneYear",
                  "TwoYear",
                  "NoLimit"
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "time_range",
            "description": "检索内容的时间范围。OneDay：1天内，OneWeek：1周内，OneMonth：1月内，OneYear：1年内，TwoYear：2年内，NoLimit：无限制",
            "default": "TwoYear",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "recall_num": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer",
                "maximum": 50.0,
                "minimum": 1.0
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "recall_num",
            "description": "查询结果要返回的文章数，取值范围1~50，默认15",
            "default": 15,
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "ranker_advanced": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "ranker_advanced",
            "description": "是否需要检索增强版的排序，默认开启",
            "default": true,
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "rewrite": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "rewrite",
            "description": "用户问题是否需要改写，默认关闭",
            "default": false,
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "search_type": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "web",
                  "image",
                  "video"
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "search_type",
            "description": "检索内容的资源类型。web：网页，image：图像（暂未上线），video：视频（暂未上线）",
            "default": "web",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "title": "universal_content_searchArguments",
        "required": [
          "query"
        ]
      }
    },
